<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Two miners killed in accident at Deelkraal.</title>
<headline>Two miners killed in accident at Deelkraal.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two mineworkers were killed in an underground accident at Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd, mine managers Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Two mineworkers were also injured in the accident which followed a seismic event 2,750 metres below surface in the area served by the No 1 Sub Shaft.</p>
<p>Deelkraal earned 4.47 million rand before capital spending in the December quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
